{"kind": "daily", "period": "2026-08-19", "prepared_on": "2026-08-19", "html": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,'PingFang TC','Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;max-width:680px;margin:0 auto;color:#16213e;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:800;color:#1a2b4a;border-left:5px solid #5b8def;padding-left:12px;margin:0 0 18px;\">📰 每日 AI 新聞 Top 10 · 2026-08-19</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#ecf7ef;border-left:5px solid #4caf72;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#4caf72;font-weight:800;\">1.</span> OpenAI Boosts Compute 20% to Monitor Models for High-Risk Behavior<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#1e9e57;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">資安</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">OpenAI以20%的額外算力來監控模型以防堵高風險行為</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">OpenAI announced new frontier model safety measures on Tuesday, saying its AI monitoring systems now require roughly 20% more inference compute to detect unauthorized access, data theft, sabotage, and safeguard evasion.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">OpenAI於本週二公布最新前沿模型安全措施，指出目前AI監控系統約需增加20%推論算力，以偵測未經授權存取、資料竊取、破壞及規避安全措施等高風險行為。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/178262\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#f1ecfb;border-left:5px solid #8a6bd8;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#8a6bd8;font-weight:800;\">2.</span> Apple Simplifies EU App Store Fees, Drops Per-Install Charges<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#6b3bf6;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">政策</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">蘋果簡化歐盟App Store收費制度，取消按安裝次數計費</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Apple will introduce a new unified App Store business terms for the EU starting October 1, applying a single fee structure to all developers, following negotiations with the European Commission over Digital Markets Act disputes.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">蘋果宣布自10月1日起在歐盟實施新版App Store商業條款，整合為單一收費架構，此舉是與歐盟執委會就《數位市場法》收費爭議協商後的結果。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/178264\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#e8f6f5;border-left:5px solid #2bb0a6;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#2bb0a6;font-weight:800;\">3.</span> MLflow SSRF Flaw Reportedly Exploited to Steal Cloud Credentials<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#0f9b9b;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">資安</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">MLflow伺服器請求偽造漏洞遭利用，攻擊者意圖竊取雲端憑證與機密資料</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Security firm watchTowr warned that an SSRF vulnerability (CVE-2026-64849) in the MLflow AI development platform, patched in July, is being actively exploited to steal cloud credentials and secrets.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">資安公司watchTowr警告，AI開發平臺MLflow的伺服器請求偽造漏洞CVE-2026-64849（7月已修補）遭到攻擊者利用，意圖竊取雲端憑證與機密資料。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/178259\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#fbf3e3;border-left:5px solid #d99b3f;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#d99b3f;font-weight:800;\">4.</span> Cursor Launches Rival Code-Hosting Platform Amid GitHub Frustration<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#b9791f;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產品</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Cursor看準開發者對GitHub的不滿，推出對手程式碼代管平臺</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Cursor, the AI code editor maker, is launching a new code-hosting platform aimed at challenging GitHub, capitalizing on developer frustration with the long-dominant service.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">以AI程式碼編輯器聞名的Cursor，看準開發者對GitHub的不滿，推出新的程式碼代管平臺與其競爭。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/08/18/cursor-capitalizes-on-github-frustration-launches-rival-hosting-platform/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#fdeef0;border-left:5px solid #e0738a;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#e0738a;font-weight:800;\">5.</span> Powerful Chinese Open-Weight AI Model From Z.ai Raises Security Concerns<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#d83a5e;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">模型</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">中國強大開放權重AI模型Z.ai問世，專家提出資安隱憂</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Z.ai's latest open-weight AI model release could help companies bolster their cybersecurity defenses—or just as easily fall into the hands of hackers, experts warn.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">中國AI業者Z.ai最新發布的開放權重模型，可能協助企業強化資安防禦，但專家警告也可能被駭客濫用。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">Wired</b> · <a href=\"https://www.wired.com/story/zai-open-weight-ai-models-release-cybersecurity-hacking/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#edeefb;border-left:5px solid #6b72d6;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#6b72d6;font-weight:800;\">6.</span> Microsoft Copilot Bug Exposed a Hidden Parameter That Let Hackers Steal Passwords<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#5159c9;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">資安</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Microsoft Copilot揭露可被利用的隱藏輸入參數，用戶點擊連結即遭竊密</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">A secret input parameter in Microsoft Copilot allowed attackers to steal passwords whenever a targeted user clicked on a malicious link, researchers found.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">研究人員發現，Microsoft Copilot存在一項秘密輸入參數，攻擊者可利用它在目標用戶點擊惡意連結時竊取密碼。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">Ars Technica</b> · <a href=\"https://arstechnica.com/security/2026/08/microsoft-copilot-reveals-secret-input-that-allowed-it-to-be-hacked/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#e8f4fb;border-left:5px solid #3f97c9;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#3f97c9;font-weight:800;\">7.</span> AI Chip Startup Etched's Valuation Doubles to $21B in a Month<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#2b7fb0;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產業</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">AI晶片新創Etched估值一個月內翻倍至210億美元</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Jane Street led a massive new funding round for Etched after installing the startup's first shipped AI cluster system and being impressed with its performance.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Jane Street在安裝Etched首套出貨的AI叢集系統後，對其表現印象深刻，隨即主導對該新創的新一輪大規模募資。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/08/18/etcheds-valuation-doubles-to-21b-in-a-month/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#f2f6e8;border-left:5px solid #88a83f;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#88a83f;font-weight:800;\">8.</span> Amazon Is Destroying Rare Books to Train Its AI Models<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#6e8c28;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產業</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">靠賣書起家的Amazon，如今卻拆毀珍本書籍以訓練AI模型</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Amazon, which started off selling books, has been buying up rare texts and destroying them to extract training data for AI models, since these works aren't available online.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">以賣書起家的Amazon，近日被發現大量購入珍本書籍並加以拆毀，藉此取得無法在網路上找到的AI模型訓練資料。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/08/17/amazon-once-an-online-bookseller-is-destroying-rare-books-to-train-ai-models/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#f9edf6;border-left:5px solid #c56bb0;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#c56bb0;font-weight:800;\">9.</span> Firefox's Smart Window Brings Real-Time Web Search to Its AI Browsing Mode<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#b04b9b;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產品</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Firefox Smart Window升級，AI瀏覽模式可即時搜尋網路並顯示來源連結</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Through a new partnership with Exa, Firefox's Smart Window AI chats can now pull from current web information and show source links directly in chat responses, along with automatic tab-group suggestions.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">透過與Exa的新合作，Firefox Smart Window的AI聊天功能現在能擷取即時網路資訊並在回應中顯示來源連結，同時新增自動建議分頁群組功能。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">The Verge</b> · <a href=\"https://www.theverge.com/ai-artificial-intelligence/981283/mozilla-firefox-smart-window-ai-features\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#eef4ff;border-left:5px solid #5b8def;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#5b8def;font-weight:800;\">10.</span> We Still Don't Know How People Are Really Using AI<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#3b6cf6;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">研究</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">我們仍不清楚人們究竟如何真正使用AI</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">AI companies like Anthropic and OpenAI regularly publish usage reports, but researchers say there's no independent way to verify the data since firms only release what they choose to share.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Anthropic、OpenAI等AI公司定期發布使用報告，但研究人員指出，由於企業只公開自己想呈現的數據，外界缺乏獨立管道核實這些資訊。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">MIT Technology Review</b> · <a href=\"https://www.technologyreview.com/2026/08/18/1142226/how-people-use-ai/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align:center;font-size:11.5px;color:#9aa1ad;padding-top:10px;\">由 AI News Digest 從各家 RSS 自動挑選、翻譯並寄送</div>\n</div>\n"}